      "why": "Review round 1 advanced this without resolving it. The outfall is now located with coordinates (119\u00b044'33.10\"E, 35\u00b034'47.17\"N, between the west breakwater and the eastern trestle section) and an approval instrument exists (\u9c81\u6d77\u6e14\u51fd[2015]330\u53f7). A 2024 peer-reviewed study finds impact confined within 200 m of the outfall. But that study is a SECONDARY analysis, and no discharge permit number or permitted limits were located. A secondary summary may never be promoted to a primary ecological receipt.",
